# Never upload these in a `railway up` build context.
#
# `railway up` tars the current directory, not the git tree, so .gitignore is
# not necessarily what decides here. Two things in this repo must never leave
# the machine:
#
#   .env*           SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY (bypasses RLS entirely),
#                   SUPABASE_DB_URL (database password), LESSON_ROOM_SECRET.
#                   Railway holds all of these as service variables already.
#   db/backups/     real rows from auth.users, including password hashes.
#
# Everything else here is just build weight.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

db/backups/

node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
coverage/

.git/
*.pem
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
